# The Beast Within (battlefield.beast_within#reqs, Jade Sepulcher): six chars at _1v0, each refused with
# NO_BATTLEFIELD_ENTRY 7377 (the Lua framework's entry hooks, which Battlefield[1153], Shadows of the Mind, set up on
# _1v0) and no menu. Main (a level 75 Blue Mage at level cap 75, The Beast Within accepted at Quest[6][40]Prog 2 (GMs),
# one Blue Mage's Testimony): a trigger with no trade (a testimony fight's registrant must trade): 7377, then the door's
# default (DefaultActions.lua messageSpecial -1, shown as 32767); a trade of the Corsair's Testimony (not the required
# item): 7377. Each other trades a Blue Mage's Testimony, all else as main: bob a level 65 Blue Mage (the level alone);
# cat at Quest[6][40]Prog 3 (the var alone: the registrant's must be 2); dan with the quest available (the quest alone);
# eve with it completed (a registrant's must be accepted); fay a level 75 Warrior (the job alone).
lists JadeSepulcher/_1v0/onTrade JadeSepulcher/_1v0/onTrigger JadeSepulcher/onEventUpdate/32000 JadeSepulcher/onEventFinish/32000
char zone=JadeSepulcher pos=300,-2.517,-198.5 job=BLU lvl=75
char bob zone=JadeSepulcher pos=300,-2.517,-198.5 job=BLU lvl=65
char cat zone=JadeSepulcher pos=300,-2.517,-198.5 job=BLU lvl=75
char dan zone=JadeSepulcher pos=300,-2.517,-198.5 job=BLU lvl=75
char eve zone=JadeSepulcher pos=300,-2.517,-198.5 job=BLU lvl=75
char fay zone=JadeSepulcher pos=300,-2.517,-198.5 job=WAR lvl=75
levelcap 75
quest AhtUrhgan.AnEmptyVessel completed
quest AhtUrhgan.Transformations completed
quest AhtUrhgan.TheBeastWithin accepted
charvar Quest[6][40]Prog 2
item BlueMagesTestimony
bob: levelcap 75
bob: quest AhtUrhgan.AnEmptyVessel completed
bob: quest AhtUrhgan.Transformations completed
bob: quest AhtUrhgan.TheBeastWithin accepted
bob: charvar Quest[6][40]Prog 2
bob: item BlueMagesTestimony
cat: levelcap 75
cat: quest AhtUrhgan.AnEmptyVessel completed
cat: quest AhtUrhgan.Transformations completed
cat: quest AhtUrhgan.TheBeastWithin accepted
cat: charvar Quest[6][40]Prog 3
cat: item BlueMagesTestimony
dan: levelcap 75
dan: quest AhtUrhgan.AnEmptyVessel completed
dan: quest AhtUrhgan.Transformations completed
dan: charvar Quest[6][40]Prog 2
dan: item BlueMagesTestimony
eve: levelcap 75
eve: quest AhtUrhgan.AnEmptyVessel completed
eve: quest AhtUrhgan.Transformations completed
eve: quest AhtUrhgan.TheBeastWithin completed
eve: charvar Quest[6][40]Prog 2
eve: item BlueMagesTestimony
fay: levelcap 75
fay: quest AhtUrhgan.AnEmptyVessel completed
fay: quest AhtUrhgan.Transformations completed
fay: quest AhtUrhgan.TheBeastWithin accepted
fay: charvar Quest[6][40]Prog 2
fay: item BlueMagesTestimony
item CorsairsTestimony
login
bob: login
cat: login
dan: login
eve: login
fay: login
trigger _1v0
finish-if-event
trade _1v0 CorsairsTestimony x1
finish-if-event
bob: trade _1v0 BlueMagesTestimony x1
bob: finish-if-event
cat: trade _1v0 BlueMagesTestimony x1
cat: finish-if-event
dan: trade _1v0 BlueMagesTestimony x1
dan: finish-if-event
eve: trade _1v0 BlueMagesTestimony x1
eve: finish-if-event
fay: trade _1v0 BlueMagesTestimony x1
fay: finish-if-event
